{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49486","headline":"更漏子 · 顾敻","name":"更漏子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧欢娱，新怅望，拥鼻含嚬楼上。\n浓柳翠，晚霞微，江鸥接翼飞。\n帘半卷，屏斜掩，远岫参差迷眼。\n歌满耳，酒盈尊，前非不要论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}